[♪ tense music plays]

1323
01:50:39.199 --> 01:50:41.029
[grunting]

1324
01:50:44.962 --> 01:50:46.298
[grunts]

1325
01:51:09.625 --> 01:51:12.258
[device beeping]

1326
01:51:20.734 --> 01:51:21.734
[groans]

1327
01:51:23.869 --> 01:51:25.172
[grunts]

1328
01:51:29.645 --> 01:51:31.211
[babbles]

1329
01:51:38.688 --> 01:51:41.023
[devices beeping]

1330
01:51:59.113 --> 01:52:00.504
[grunts]

1331
01:52:01.107 --> 01:52:02.444
[electricity crackling]

1332
01:52:02.579 --> 01:52:03.639
[metal creaking]

1333
01:52:05.848 --> 01:52:07.181
[electricity crackles]

1334
01:52:08.079 --> 01:52:09.513
[babbles]

1335
01:52:10.447 --> 01:52:12.549
[♪ gentle music plays]

1336
01:52:24.194 --> 01:52:25.998
[speaks Huttese]

1337
01:52:26.133 --> 01:52:27.832
[Hutt Sister speaks Huttese]

1338
01:52:27.967 --> 01:52:29.966
[in Huttese]

1339
01:52:30.102 --> 01:52:31.744
Go help Rotta.

1340
01:52:33.240 --> 01:52:34.838
[Hutt Brother speaks Huttese]

1341
01:52:34.974 --> 01:52:37.574
- [Hutt Brother speaks Huttese]
- [Hutt Sister speaks Huttese]

1342
01:52:38.780 --> 01:52:39.780
[speaks Huttese]

1343
01:52:39.847 --> 01:52:41.512
You saw my face.

1344
01:52:42.212 --> 01:52:43.047
[in Huttese]

1345
01:52:43.182 --> 01:52:44.182
[Hutt Sister gasping]

1346
01:52:44.217 --> 01:52:45.648
Now it's time to die.

1347
01:52:55.532 --> 01:52:56.593
[grunts]

1348
01:53:01.604 --> 01:53:03.006
[grunts]

1349
01:53:05.040 --> 01:53:07.604
[♪ majestic music plays]

1350
01:53:08.911 --> 01:53:10.145
[machinery powers down]

1351
01:53:10.646 --> 01:53:12.147
[sighs]

1352
01:53:13.477 --> 01:53:15.315
[♪ tense music plays]

1353
01:53:21.758 --> 01:53:22.993
[Embo grunts]

1354
01:53:24.793 --> 01:53:26.425
[both grunting]

1355
01:53:26.928 --> 01:53:28.064
[Embo grunts]

1356
01:53:30.394 --> 01:53:32.200
[The Mandalorian shouts]

1357
01:53:33.670 --> 01:53:35.500
[Embo grunting]

1358
01:53:37.300 --> 01:53:38.536
[both grunt]

1359
01:53:39.810 --> 01:53:41.638
[Grogu exclaims. groans]

1360
01:53:42.978 --> 01:53:44.377
[Hutt Brother growls]

1361
01:53:46.913 --> 01:53:48.383
[grunts]

1362
01:53:48.953 --> 01:53:50.979
- [whimpers]
- [slurps]

1363
01:53:51.115 --> 01:53:52.649
[growls]

1364
01:53:53.557 --> 01:53:54.317
[growls]

1365
01:53:54.453 --> 01:53:55.751
[in English] Leave him alone!

1366
01:53:57.495 --> 01:53:58.495
[groans]

1367
01:53:59.093 --> 01:54:01.262
[both grunting. roaring]

1368
01:54:06.768 --> 01:54:07.768
[grunts]

1369
01:54:09.771 --> 01:54:10.771
[grunts]

1370
01:54:11.874 --> 01:54:13.439
[weapon clatters]

1371
01:54:15.272 --> 01:54:17.311
[grunts. pants]

1372
01:54:17.846 --> 01:54:20.710
[in Huttese]

1373
01:54:24.986 --> 01:54:26.716
[all grunting]

1374
01:54:34.433 --> 01:54:35.461
[snarls]

1375
01:54:36.028 --> 01:54:37.265
[growls]

1376
01:54:38.197 --> 01:54:39.432
[Embo grunts]

1377
01:54:43.005 --> 01:54:44.305
[The Mandalorian grunts]

1378
01:54:46.809 --> 01:54:49.607
[growling]

1379
01:54:50.108 --> 01:54:51.213
[snarls]

1380
01:54:55.950 --> 01:54:57.252
[Force rumbling]

1381
01:55:08.567 --> 01:55:10.496
[both grunting]

1382
01:55:13.771 --> 01:55:15.534
[Rotta shouts]

1383
01:55:24.916 --> 01:55:26.846
[♪ gentle music plays]

1384
01:55:26.981 --> 01:55:28.514
[Keibu snoring]

1385
01:55:30.215 --> 01:55:32.353
[both grunting]

1386
01:55:33.426 --> 01:55:34.426
[grunts]

1387
01:55:38.257 --> 01:55:39.360
[Embo grunts]

1388
01:55:40.895 --> 01:55:42.264
[snarls]

1389
01:55:45.168 --> 01:55:47.368
[Hutt Brother. Rotta grunting]

1390
01:55:53.942 --> 01:55:57.345
[in Huttese]

1391
01:55:58.276 --> 01:56:00.216
[Hutts yell]

1392
01:56:06.020 --> 01:56:08.352
[Force rumbling]

1393
01:56:08.488 --> 01:56:12.261
[♪ uplifting music plays]

1394
01:56:27.139 --> 01:56:28.442
[gasps]

1395
01:56:34.818 --> 01:56:37.715
[both groaning]

1396
01:56:39.954 --> 01:56:41.624
[roars]

1397
01:56:41.759 --> 01:56:43.424
[in Huttese]

1398
01:56:44.698 --> 01:56:45.723
Keibu. [speaks Kyuzo]

1399
01:56:47.934 --> 01:56:50.135
[Hutt Brother speaks Huttese]

1400
01:56:50.671 --> 01:56:52.937
[Hutt Brother exclaims]

1401
01:56:53.072 --> 01:56:55.106
- [screams]
- [Hutt brother groaning]

1402
01:56:59.842 --> 01:57:01.310
[groans]

1403
01:57:02.549 --> 01:57:03.549
[screams]

1404
01:57:14.693 --> 01:57:15.957
[metal banging]

1405
01:57:16.093 --> 01:57:18.129
[♪ tense music plays]

1406
01:57:19.326 --> 01:57:21.432
[banging continues]

1407
01:57:21.567 --> 01:57:24.498
We don't have much time.
We have to get out of here.

1408
01:57:25.267 --> 01:57:26.399
Is there another way out?

1409
01:57:26.535 --> 01:57:29.470
- I think it's that way.
- Go. Go!

1410
01:57:45.823 --> 01:57:46.982
Target sighted.

1411
01:57:47.661 --> 01:57:48.661
[droid yells]

1412
01:58:10.948 --> 01:58:12.615
[static on comms]

1413
01:58:12.750 --> 01:58:14.175
Hello?

1414
01:58:14.311 --> 01:58:15.491
[Anzellan 1 through comms]
<i>Mando! We came back.</i>

1415
01:58:15.515 --> 01:58:16.853
- What?
- We came back.

1416
01:58:16.988 --> 01:58:18.690
We told you we would.

1417
01:58:18.826 --> 01:58:21.049
[♪ hopeful music plays]

1418
01:58:25.596 --> 01:58:29.391
[Ward] <i>Adelphi Squadron.</i>
<i>entering atmosphere.</i>

1419
01:58:29.526 --> 01:58:32.533
- What's your status. Mando?
- <i>We're under attack.</i>

1420
01:58:33.301 --> 01:58:34.500
There are too many.

1421
01:58:34.636 --> 01:58:37.065
Fire everything you have
at my location.

1422
01:58:38.268 --> 01:58:41.372
- [Ward] <i>Your location?</i>
- Yes. my location.

1423
01:58:41.508 --> 01:58:43.043
I can't give that order.

1424
01:58:43.178 --> 01:58:44.710
Don't worry...

1425
01:58:46.485 --> 01:58:49.077
we'll be out of here
by the time you do.

1426
01:58:50.547 --> 01:58:51.317
Good luck.

1427
01:58:51.452 --> 01:58:53.191
[X-wing engines screeching]

1428
01:58:55.059 --> 01:58:56.625
Blue Leader to squadron.

1429
01:58:56.761 --> 01:58:59.927
<i>assume defensive formation.
prepare to engage.</i>

1430
01:59:00.062 --> 01:59:01.126
All weapons hot.

1431
01:59:01.261 --> 01:59:02.365
Copy that.

1432
01:59:13.977 --> 01:59:15.708
[droid chatter]

1433
01:59:19.810 --> 01:59:21.346
Enemy fighters approaching.

1434
01:59:21.482 --> 01:59:23.621
[♪ heroic music plays]

1435
01:59:23.756 --> 01:59:24.756
Here they come.

1436
01:59:32.556 --> 01:59:33.792
[Rotta grunting]

1437
01:59:34.295 --> 01:59:35.490
[Rotta roars]

1438
01:59:35.626 --> 01:59:37.026
[droid beeps]

1439
01:59:46.207 --> 01:59:47.542
[chuckles]

1440
01:59:51.885 --> 01:59:53.275
Turbolasers. up ahead.

1441
01:59:53.411 --> 01:59:54.582
Got it.

1442
02:00:15.272 --> 02:00:17.033
I've got one on my tail.

1443
02:00:19.570 --> 02:00:21.213
I got you.

1444
02:00:26.951 --> 02:00:28.176
[squeaks]

1445
02:00:31.091 --> 02:00:32.715
- [cheers]
- Yippee! Yay!

1446
02:00:32.850 --> 02:00:34.556
Taking out the launch tubes.

1447
02:00:41.930 --> 02:00:45.270
Blue Leader to Red Jammer.
mark it and lock it in.

1448
02:00:47.632 --> 02:00:48.768
Locking in target.

1449
02:00:52.307 --> 02:00:53.575
It's a dead end.

1450
02:00:54.772 --> 02:00:56.347
We're trapped.

1451
02:00:56.882 --> 02:00:58.250
Stand back.

1452
02:01:04.315 --> 02:01:05.827
[Ward through comms]
<i>We're closing fast.</i>

1453
02:01:05.851 --> 02:01:07.114
Repeat. we're closing fast.

1454
02:01:07.250 --> 02:01:08.859
You better be
out of there. Mando.

1455
02:01:08.995 --> 02:01:10.259
[The Mandalorian] Jump.

1456
02:01:10.395 --> 02:01:12.588
[Rotta]
That's a long way down.

1457
02:01:12.723 --> 02:01:13.928
Closing on target.

1458
02:01:15.131 --> 02:01:17.693
- [The Mandalorian] Gotta jump.
- [Rotta] Moat's not that deep.

1459
02:01:17.829 --> 02:01:19.795
It's a bomber. Jump.

1460
02:01:19.931 --> 02:01:21.999
Let's light up this swamp.

1461
02:01:32.819 --> 02:01:34.286
[yelling]

1462
02:01:56.409 --> 02:01:58.310
[pilot]
<i>Anybody got eyes on Mando?</i>

1463
02:01:58.845 --> 02:01:59.874
There they are.

1464
02:02:00.477 --> 02:02:02.776
[♪ uplifting music plays]

1465
02:02:04.150 --> 02:02:08.177
Zeb. go collect the trash.

1466
02:02:15.861 --> 02:02:18.926
I'm getting a little tired
of these hot extractions.

1467
02:02:19.729 --> 02:02:21.733
- What took you so long?
- [Grogu babbles]

1468
02:02:21.868 --> 02:02:22.930
[chuckles]

1469
02:02:23.066 --> 02:02:24.099
Hop in.

1470
02:02:24.234 --> 02:02:26.338
Let's head home.

1471
02:02:31.376 --> 02:02:33.609
[♪ triumphant music plays]

1472
02:02:49.026 --> 02:02:50.560
Colonel.

1473
02:02:52.799 --> 02:02:54.289
Messy.

1474
02:02:54.758 --> 02:02:56.192
Very messy.

1475
02:02:57.137 --> 02:02:58.565
Why'd you come for me?

1476
02:02:58.701 --> 02:03:00.528
That wasn't part of the mission.

1477
02:03:01.331 --> 02:03:04.668
You were right.
Coin told us everything.

1478
02:03:04.804 --> 02:03:06.235
The Twins were playing us.

1479
02:03:06.370 --> 02:03:09.172
Feeding information
to the Empire all along.

1480
02:03:10.241 --> 02:03:13.341
They picked a side.
It wasn't ours.

1481
02:03:13.476 --> 02:03:17.485
Besides.
we don't leave our own behind.

1482
02:03:17.620 --> 02:03:19.386
I'm an independent contractor.

1483
02:03:19.522 --> 02:03:22.618
Sure. Mando. Sure you are.

1484
02:03:22.753 --> 02:03:24.286
[Grogu exclaims]

1485
02:03:33.231 --> 02:03:35.098
Can I give you a ride somewhere?

1486
02:03:35.234 --> 02:03:38.100
Actually. I was thinking
I could stay here.

1487
02:03:38.236 --> 02:03:40.411
Maybe work for the New Republic.

1488
02:03:40.547 --> 02:03:43.005
Don't take this
the wrong way. but...

1489
02:03:43.140 --> 02:03:45.114
I'm not sure you would fit in.

1490
02:03:45.250 --> 02:03:47.045
You know... [grunts]

1491
02:03:47.180 --> 02:03:49.620
I might have
a uniform that would fit him.

1492
02:03:50.423 --> 02:03:53.557
Come on. let me buy you a drink.

1493
02:03:55.155 --> 02:03:57.720
Thank you. Mando.
I owe you big time.

1494
02:03:57.855 --> 02:03:59.524
Just doing my job.

1495
02:03:59.660 --> 02:04:00.863
And keep an eye on him.

1496
02:04:01.733 --> 02:04:03.559
Your dad's one of the good ones.

1497
02:04:03.694 --> 02:04:04.733
[coos]

1498
02:04:15.548 --> 02:04:17.839
[Anzellans chattering
indistinctly]

1499
02:04:17.974 --> 02:04:19.081
Come on. big guy.

1500
02:04:20.084 --> 02:04:23.081
[Anzellan 2] Watch your step.
First round's on me.

1501
02:04:27.293 --> 02:04:29.120
[♪ wistful music plays]

1502
02:04:31.989 --> 02:04:34.029
Hey. kid. Come up here.

1503
02:04:34.164 --> 02:04:35.423
[coos]

1504
02:04:40.764 --> 02:04:42.001
[grunts]

1505
02:04:53.814 --> 02:04:55.212
[The Mandalorian] Your turn.

1506
02:04:57.914 --> 02:04:59.150
Go ahead.

1507
02:05:10.402 --> 02:05:12.636
[♪ epic music plays]

1508
02:05:26.610 --> 02:05:30.313
[♪ “The Mandalorian”
theme plays]

1509
02:06:22.035 --> 02:06:24.532
[♪ electronic music plays]

1510
02:07:34.447 --> 02:07:37.539
[♪ ominous music plays]

1511
02:08:05.137 --> 02:08:09.175
[♪ gentle music plays]

1512
02:09:10.268 --> 02:09:14.009
[♪ dramatic music plays]

1513
02:09:28.287 --> 02:09:30.520
[♪ dramatic music continues]

1514
02:10:27.749 --> 02:10:31.053
[♪ guitar version of
“The Mandalorian” theme plays]

1514
